WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,350
Is there anything you want to trade? Golden medicine?

2
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:07,790
I can't use the ones I picked up at the empty gold store.

3
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:09,310
The base has no shortage of gold

4
00:00:09,870 --> 00:00:10,830
You know what is missing most

5
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:17,140
It’s not about materials, it’s about people, especially artists.

6
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,820
I'll give you all those wild crane carcasses.

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:21,620
Replacing two military radios with insufficient supporting equipment

8
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:23,580
There aren’t many radio stations in the north.

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,740
Plus the two crane claws on the Juhe hand collar

10
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:28,020
Add a crane head and two legs

11
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:41,460
It's okay to build a crane with a crane's neck. It's not enough to turn its neck into legs. Only the claws are used to deal with your safe zone.

12
00:00:41,580 --> 00:00:42,620
How many people have been gathered now?

13
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:45,450
Ran out of the whole city

14
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:49,930
If you put together a piece, it would cost nearly half a small amount of tens of thousands, right? Is Brigitte Taiping okay?

15
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,570
Nothing messy

16
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:56,180
Everyone is working hard to survive. The radio station you want has arrived. Come on.
